Scoped gradfun debanding filter

The option table, init() threshold and radius rounding, config_input chroma
radius, the per-plane min(w,h) > 2r filter condition, filter() with its ring of
cumulative 2x2 half-row sums and sliding horizontal box, ff_gradfun_blur_line_c,
ff_gradfun_filter_line_c and the fixed 8x8 ordered dither table in
src/video-ops/gradfun.ts follow libavfilter/vf_gradfun.c (gradfun_options,
pix_fmts, init, config_input, filter_frame, filter, dither,
ff_gradfun_filter_line_c, ff_gradfun_blur_line_c) and libavfilter/gradfun.h.
